%% Source ingestion and validation pipeline for the handbook
%% Source: README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md
flowchart LR
  Web[Curated URLs] --> Fetch[fetch-source.ps1]
  Fetch --> Pages[sources/pages/*.md]
  Fetch --> Index[sources/_index.csv]
  Pages --> Synth[Author docs/*.md with citation tags]
  Index --> Validate[validate-claims.ps1]
  Synth --> Validate
  Synth --> Diagrams[diagrams/*.mmd]
  Examples[examples/helm + k8s] --> LocalK8s[kind/minikube smoke test]
  LocalK8s --> Synth
  Validate --> Handbook[Internal handbook]
  Diagrams --> Handbook
